# Although and despite in Russian: хотя, несмотря на
subtitle: "No salt in the soup, yet the critic liked it: say although, despite and but then in Russian with хотя́, несмотря́ на and зато́."
tags: ["russian","хотя","несмотря на","linking words","russian grammar"]
teaches: ["grammar/linking-words"]
thumb: "band \"Although, in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"A twelfth Russian story: white nights","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/120-russian-review-12.cast"}

