    '|a||Although and despite in Russian: хотя, несмотря на':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||No salt in the soup, yet the critic liked it: say although, despite and but then in Russian with хотя́, несмотря́ на and зато́.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 12240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1s8ies2'
    '|a||How do you say although in Russian? Ию́нь, рестора́н «Нева́». This morning my boss, О́льга Серге́евна, has news.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Послу́шайте. Was the news good or bad?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:12dkz6q'
    '|b||Том, вчера́ у нас был крити́к.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2400
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:b5vi0p'
    '|a||И? Я сде́лал оши́бку: забы́л положи́ть соль в суп!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Хотя́ суп был без со́ли, о́тзыв хоро́ший!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3160
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Пра́вда? Зато́ ры́ба была́ вку́сная!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3200
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What was the review like?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||О́тзыв хоро́ший: the review is good.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3160
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What was Tom''s mistake?':
      mp3: 
